{"id":"b823f18a7fc28400","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-godel-sentence.md","title":"Gödel Sentence $\\gamma$","display":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence $\\gamma$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-godel-sentence","aliases":["92-df-godel-sentence"],"display":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence $\\gamma$","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"],"source":"本地可证等价固定点；原书第 VIII–IX 章 pp.102–110 提供 Gödel/Henkin/Löb 与 HBL 背景；本地字符串和数码编码另行指定","source_status":"原书固定点概念的本地定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-godel-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-godel-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地可证等价固定点；原书第 VIII–IX 章 pp.102–110 提供 Gödel/Henkin/Löb 与 HBL 背景；本地字符串和数码编码另行指定"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书固定点概念的本地定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (provability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span> (definition-target Gödel-sentence predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>（也常记作<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_G\">\\(G_G\\)</span>）是相对于系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>及所选可证性公式的Gödel句子，并在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证等价于“我的码不可证”</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a>保证满足该固定点条件的句子存在</li>\n<li>实际构造先对含对角函数表示式的辅助公式作自代入；一般不能把最终句子的码误写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\ulcorner\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\urcorner)\">\\(d(\\ulcorner\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对有效可公理化、含足够基本算术并满足相应一致性条件的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，该固定点给出不完备性见证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元